; error: 10:15: 'x' is given the place itself, to change, so it can't be an item of a slice, which moves when the slice grows; give the slice and the item's index, or copy the item into a 'hold' variable, change it, and put it back
task sample(hold& x: int)
    x = 10
fi

task main()
    region r
    hold xs = new [int]() at r
    xs.add(1)
    sample(&xs[0])
fi
